flowchart TD
 A[Start] --> B[Listen]
 B --> C{Speech recognized?}
 C -- No --> D[Explain error / retry]
 D --> B
 C -- Yes --> E[Normalize phrase]
 E --> F{Known command?}
 F -- Yes --> G[Run allow-listed skill]
 F -- No --> H[Unknown-command response]
 G --> I[Print and speak response]
 H --> I
 I --> J{Exit requested?}
 J -- No --> B
 J -- Yes --> K[Shutdown]
